    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a3">

                <pb facs="0053" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg47"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Her Britannic Majesty’s Ship Carysfort</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Honolulu Harbor</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1843-02-16"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                16, 1843</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acquaint your Majesty
                    of the arrival in this port of Her Britannic Majesty’s ship, under my command,
                    and, according <pb facs="0054" n="48" xml:id="pg48"/> to my instructions, I am
                    desired to demand a private interview with you, to which I shall proceed with a
                    proper and competent interpreter. I therefore request to be informed at what
                    hour to-morrow it will be convenient for your Majesty to grant me that
                    interview.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain your Majesty’s</p>
                <p>Most obedient and humble servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. Paulet</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Captain.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To His Majesty <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kamehameha III</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
